1
00:00:00,121 --> 00:00:01,501
(Raj:)Half of it will be mine.

2
00:00:01,998 --> 00:00:04,918
(Sheldon:)Do you need it
to buy a less disturbing sweater vest?

3
00:00:08,004 --> 00:00:09,634
(Raj:)-Leonard, help.
-Are you kidding?

4
00:00:09,797 --> 00:00:13,547
(Leonard:)I couldn't even talk him into giving me
one of his freaking napkins.

5
00:00:15,011 --> 00:00:16,511
[SIGHS]

6
00:00:17,430 --> 00:00:20,810
(Penny:)Wow, you really are a genius.

7
00:00:21,726 --> 00:00:25,816
(Leonard:)Not really. I Googled how to do that.

8
00:00:27,982 --> 00:00:30,732
(Leonard:)So listen....

9
00:00:31,652 --> 00:00:34,692
(Leonard:)Have you ever made a pact
with someone?

10
00:00:34,864 --> 00:00:36,494
(Penny:)You mean like a pinky swear?

11
00:00:37,784 --> 00:00:40,664
(Leonard:)Okay, fine. Like a pinky swear.

12
00:00:40,870 --> 00:00:46,000
(Penny:)In the first grade, my friend Rosie and I
made a pact to marry Bert and Ernie.

13
00:00:46,376 --> 00:00:49,506
(Penny:)-You know, from Sesame Street.
-I'm familiar with Bert and Ernie.

14
00:00:50,296 --> 00:00:52,506
(Penny:)Then we found out
we both wanted Ernie.

15
00:00:52,673 --> 00:00:55,263
(Penny:)We didn't speak again
till middle school.

16
00:00:55,927 --> 00:00:57,057
(Leonard:)Over puppets?

17
00:00:57,220 --> 00:01:00,390
(Penny:)The heart wants what the heart wants,
Leonard.

